@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### All events
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/events

### One event
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/events/1

### Create an event
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Brass Band Evening",
  "city": "Salzburg",
  "startsAt": "2027-05-20T19:30:00",
  "capacity": 200,
  "price": 29.00
}

### Create a broken event
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "city": "Salzburg",
  "startsAt": "2020-01-01T19:00:00",
  "capacity": -5,
  "price": 25.00
}
